   "text": "Early Swedish reef yields reported by Junner include 144 oz from 90 lb of quartz at 21 ft (June 1859), 240 oz from 60 lb at 21 ft (Aug 1859) and 80 oz from one bucket of ore at 64 ft (Jan 1860). In 1865 at 50 ft, 16.5 tons gave 349 oz and 13 tons gave 134 oz 7 dwt. The scan is OCR-damaged, so figures are uncertain.",
