   "title": "Weekend Notes - Queenstown Cemetery, Smiths Gully",
   "why": "Cemetery is local evidence of the Queenstown goldfield community. Not fetched; one Victorian Collections record dating its closure to 1851 looks like a typo (first burial reported 1861).",
   "snippet": "Queenstown Cemetery, Smiths Gully Road, St Andrews."
